2\. Registries reject reused schema ids <code>🐞 Bug</code> <code>≡ Correctness</code>

<pre>
<b><i>compileSchema()</i></b> compiles every Node schema through the module-global <b><i>sharedAjv</i></b>, so Ajv retains
<b><i>$id</i></b> registrations across otherwise independent registry and manifest-validation operations.
Registering or validating a distinct schema with an identifier previously used by another registry
or manifest now throws and is surfaced as an invalid schema error.
</pre>


